; This has been extracted from
; https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/master/pages/sunos/devfsadm.md

% devfsadm, sunos

# Scan for new disks
devfsadm -c disk

# Clean up any dangling `/dev` links and scan for new devices
devfsadm -C -v

# Simulate what would happen but make no modifications
devfsadm -C -v -n
